   <standOff><listPerson><person xml:id="person3765"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">śākyaprabha</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">mang du thos pa'i slob dpon shAkya 'od</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">shAkya 'od</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">shag kya 'od</persName><sex value="M"/><nationality>Indic</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P0AT0383</idno><idno type="APIS">3765</idno></person><person xml:id="person3818"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bya 'dul 'dzin brtson 'grus 'bar</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">བྱ་འདུལ་འཛིན་བརྩོན་འགྲུས་འབར</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bya 'dul 'dzin</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bya 'dul brtson 'grus 'bar</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bya 'du ba 'dzin ba brtson 'grus 'bar</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dge bshes zul phu ba</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sangs rgyas bya 'dul 'dzin brtson 'grus 'bar</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">zul bya 'dul ba 'dzin pa</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">zul phul bya 'dul ba 'dzin pa chen po</persName><birth notBefore="1091-01-01" notAfter="1100-12-31">after 1091 before 1100</birth><death notBefore="1147-01-01" notAfter="1174-12-31">after 1147 before 1174</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P2273</idno><idno type="APIS">3818</idno><note type="comment">Born in 1091 at gTsang rong gyung and died at the age of 76 in Zul phu according to [R894SIKE]: 109.&#13;
[W4T5ZMUP]: 38 accordingly proposes the dates 1091-1166.&#13;
[VKBZTBWN], fol. 3b6 reports that he was born the year rNgog lo (ID:3786) came back to Tibet, i.e., ca. 1092.&#13;
On his life, based on the Zul phu mkhan byang chub rin chen dpal bzang po'i rnam par thar pa (ID:6715), see [W4T5ZMUP]: 40.&#13;
It is unclear whether he is the same person as rGya 'dul ba 'dzin pa (ID:4193). The [NA9AMDH6] distinguishes two "rGya 'dul 'dzin" - the elder (ID: 3941) and the younger (ID:4193) - and a "Bya 'dul 'dzin brTson 'grus 'bar" (student of 'Bre chen po). In contrast, the [R894SIKE] only mentions one "rGya 'dul 'dzin" (the elder), distinct from "Bya 'dul 'dzin" (who was ordained by 'Bre).&#13;
[VKBZTBWN], fol. 6b5-6 and [8VLVHDR2], fol. 14b5 report that he was ordained by 'Bre and received from him the name in religion brTson 'grus 'bar.&#13;
A number of the same teachers are mentioned for rGya 'dul 'dzin the younger and Bya 'dul 'dzin but, for instance, the latter's studies with rGya 'dul 'dzin the older took place when he was a retired abbot, whereas the former's studies with him took place when he was still abbot.&#13;
Further, rGya 'dul 'dzin the younger became abbot of dGa' ba sdong and Bya 'dul abbot of Zul phu.&#13;
This suggests they might have been distinct persons.</note></person><person xml:id="person3860"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">glang lung pa brtson 'grus gzhon nu</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">གླང་ལུང་པ་བརྩོན་འགྲུས་གཞོན་ནུ</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rin po che glang lung pa</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rin chen glang lung pa</persName><birth notBefore="1123-01-01" notAfter="1123-12-31">1123</birth><death notBefore="1193-01-01" notAfter="1193-12-31">1193</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P3722</idno><idno type="APIS">3860</idno><note type="comment">Dates according to [Q922IUFM]: 24. He received an oral tradition of Atiśa from Nam mkha' rdo rje, and put it into writing in the form of a lam rim treatise, and received another oral tradition traced to rNal 'byor pa ([Q922IUFM]: 24).</note></person><person xml:id="person3965"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dbon dpal chen rdo rje gzhon nu</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">དབོན་དཔལ་ཆེན་རྡོ་རྗེ་གཞོན་ནུ</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">thag ma pa rdo rje gzhon nu</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">thag ma rdor gzhon</persName><birth notBefore="1100-01-01">after 1100</birth><death notBefore="1139-01-01" notAfter="1199-12-31">after 1139 before 1199</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P1319</idno><idno type="APIS">3965</idno></person><person xml:id="person3967"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sbal ti jo sras brtson 'grus dbang phyug</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">སྦལ་ཏི་ཇོ་སྲས་བརྩོན་འགྲུས་དབང་ཕྱུག</persName><birth notBefore="1129-01-01" notAfter="1129-12-31">1129</birth><death notBefore="1215-01-01" notAfter="1215-12-31">1215</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P1320</idno><idno type="APIS">3967</idno><note type="comment">A khu ching distinguishes a "sbal ti jo sras", author of a "'du ba" from "sbal ti 'dul 'dzin" (ID:8084) also an author of works on monastic rules, of a commentary on the Prātimokṣasūtra (ID:3690), and on the Sum brgya ba  (see [5RXEUKD9]: 537, respectively No. 11709 and Nos. 11710-12).&#13;
&#13;
[JUARFJSX]: 71, n. 205 doubts the identification of "brtson 'grus dbang phyug" - the author of (ID:4720) - as sBal ti jo sras, suggesting, rather that the author could have been a student of Phya pa (ID:3831). In that case, (ID:4720) would be a different work from the one listed by A khu ching shes rab rgya mtsho in his Tho yig ([5RXEUKD9]: 529, No. 11509: sbal ti jo sras kyi 'dul ba).</note></person><person xml:id="person3979"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sha mi smon lam tshul khrims</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ཤ་མི་སྨོན་ལམ་ཚུལ་ཁྲིམས</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sha mi 'dul 'dzin chen po</persName><birth notBefore="1085-01-01" notAfter="1085-12-31">1085</birth><death notBefore="1171-01-01" notAfter="1171-12-31">1171</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P1315</idno><idno type="APIS">3979</idno></person><person xml:id="person3980"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dmar lung sgang pa</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">དམར་ལུང་སྒང་པ</persName><birth notBefore="1060-01-01" notAfter="1195-12-31">after 1060 before 1195</birth><death notBefore="1137-01-01" notAfter="1275-12-31">after 1137 before 1275</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="APIS">3980</idno></person><person xml:id="person3981"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">nya mo skyur pa</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ཉ་མོ་སྐྱུར་པ</persName><birth notAfter="1207-12-31">before 1207</birth><death notBefore="1137-01-01" notAfter="1287-12-31">after 1137 before 1287</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="APIS">3981</idno></person><person xml:id="person3982"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">yang sgom pa</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ཡང་སྒོམ་པ</persName><birth notAfter="1195-12-31">before 1195</birth><death notBefore="1137-01-01" notAfter="1275-12-31">after 1137 before 1275</death><sex value="M"/